#==============================================================================================
#
#   image_provider - Layout::ImageProvider: what an ImageBox asks of its image's source
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/ImageProvider.cpp (lines 1-44) and ImageProvider.h: the mixin's
#       non-pure members (the intrinsic size, the default bitmaps, the default visit_edges and
#       did_update_alt_text). Its pure virtuals keep trapping; each class mixing it in has its
#       own table (HTMLImageElement, HTMLObjectElement, SVGImageElement and the TreeBuilder's
#       GeneratedContentImageProvider).
#
#       Copyright (c) 2022, Andreas Kling <andreas@ladybird.org>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
#==============================================================================================

